## abtts
Convert text like ebooks into audiobooks with UnrealSpeech.


<div class='project-release'>

|Released|Description|Download|
|--------|-----------|--------|
|2023-07-05|Added introduction audio option| [abtts-v0.3.tar.gz](/projects/abtts-v0.3.tar.gz) |
